{"name":"The Tally Glass","slug":"glyph-tally-glass","blurb":"On the designate street, Esme carries the glass toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Tally. Click the glass and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Tally Glass.","seal":"67b40adb5ba217906f2046f38182bad50da13de85cc4eaf2c4e2e5b69659c14c"}
